s-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=He%20grabs%20his%20head,top%20of%20his%20lungs.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e3","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag persuades Olrich to host Zita's effigy sales at the Mockturne by promising him an audience at Rix Maadi.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","zita"],"location":"the-mockturne","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":608,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":47,"quote":"I'll call in a favor. I'll get you an audience at Rix Maadi!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%27ll%20call%20in%20a,audience%20at%20Rix%20Maadi%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%27ll%20call%20in%20a,audience%20at%20Rix%20Maadi%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e5","era":null,"summary":"On the way home Zita fixes graffiti insulting Dovin Baan, and an Azorius arrester arrests her for defacing a building and slandering a Grand Arbiter, with Kodolaag's statement logged against her.","participants":["zita","kodolaag","dovin-baan","azorius-senate"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":608,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":86,"quote":"defacing a public building,\" he continues, \"Plus Azorius code 6342-P, slandering a Grand Arbiter,\" the arrester says, binding Zita up","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=defacing%20a%20public%20building%2C%22,says%2C%20binding%20Zita%20up","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=defacing%20a%20public%20building%2C%22,says%2C%20binding%20Zita%20up","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e8","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag finds Zita under an Azorius spell that makes prisoners praise their imprisonment and realizes everything is not fine.","participants":["kodolaag","zita","udzec"],"location":"udzec","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":608,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":139,"quote":"The guards must be forcing the prisoners to speak fondly about their internment—or else.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20guards%20must%20be,about%20their%20internment%E2%80%94or%20else.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20guards%20must%20be,about%20their%20internment%E2%80%94or%20else.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e9","era":null,"summary":"Zita brings a guard's drawing in a coloring book to life, and Kodolaag draws every guard on blight parchment and tears the pages, incapacitating them.","participants":["zita","kodolaag","olrich","blight-parchment"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":608,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":148,"quote":"Electric magic ignites the paper, and the guards wail out in unison as if they're being burned alive.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e10","era":null,"summary":"Olrich impersonates Dovin Baan to hold off a soldier, and the trio walks out among exiting visitors.","participants":["olrich","kodolaag","zita","dovin-baan"],"location":"udzec","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":608,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":150,"quote":"Citizens! Behold! It is I, your highly esteemed Grand Arbiter, Protector of Justice, Purveyor of Protocols!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e11","era":null,"summary":"Jitka Wothis and a vampire identify Kodolaag and Olrich, who are bound by magic; Zita escapes into the crowd.","participants":["jitka-wothis","kodolaag","olrich","zita"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":608,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":157,"quote":"Before we can deny it, Olrich and I are bound up in magic.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e15","era":null,"summary":"Lucinka tells Zita, Olrich and Kodolaag they can never return to their old lives and should form a troupe in the undercity to hunt dangerous escapees.","participants":["lucinka","zita","olrich","kodolaag"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":608,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":178,"quote":"You'll have to set up new lives in the undercity,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=You%27ll%20have%20to%20set,lives%20in%20the%20undercity%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=You%27ll%20have%20to%20set,lives%20in%20the%20undercity%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"kodolaag-e0","era":{"date":"2019-01-25","era":"rna","label":"Ravnica Allegiance"},"summary":"Kodolaag meets Zita in her shop and fails to invite her to the Mockturne.","participants":["kodolaag","zita","olrich"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"wiki/kodolaag","order":1369,"story_date":"","storyline":"Ravnica","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":4,"quote":"Kodolaag finally managed to invite Zita to the Mockturne.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag#:~:text=Kodolaag%20finally%20managed%20to,Zita%20to%20the%20Mockturne.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kodolaag","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag#:~:text=Kodolaag%20finally%20managed%20to,Zita%20to%20the%20Mockturne.","archived":null,"l